/Implement a simple subroutine called swap 
/that swap the values of two variables with each other, 
/i.e., it takes the values in the memory location X and Y, 
/swap them, and returns to where the original program left off. 
Load X
Output
Load Y
Output
Jns swap
Load X
Output
Load Y
Output
Halt

swap,   dec 0
        Load Y
        Store Tem   /Store Y
        Load X
        Store Y
        Load Tem    /Store Y
        Store X
        JumpI swap

X,      dec 10
Y,      dec 20
Tem,    dec 0